olving, concentration, attention, and that his hot temper may be less dangerous than B's uncooperativeness. Also note D's stress response is adequate but combined with strong problem solving and responsibility, may be sufficient. Also note B's weak memory for numbers is a safety risk. So we can keep D.\n\nThus produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE: I am less convinced by B's profile because of weak memory and uncooperative behavior, while D's strengths in responsibility, problem solving, concentration, and adequate stress response outweigh his arrogance/hot temper, which can be mitigated. So I maintain recommendation for D.\n\nNow produce METADATA_JSON with vote Candidate D."}
